WEBVTT

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.250
When I was young,

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.760
I was surrounded by the love of
 my mother, father, and grandma.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.230
I was so happy.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:20.140
I wanted it to stay that way forever and ever.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:25.610
I am but a mirror that reflects you.

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.710
Cure Blossom Mirage.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:30.710
So please,

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.590
don't hate me.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:40.070
And please, don't get rid of me!

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.240
HeartCatch

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.690
Precure!

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.280
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.240
Now, all together

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.750
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.750
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.340
Within each of our chests,

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.010
they begin to sprout

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.680
The seeds of the heart

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:18.970
are growing

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.600
bit by bit

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.260
Red,

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:22.880
white

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:24.140
and yellow

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.890
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.350
all varied colors

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:29.830
that they

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.030
shine so brightly!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:37.320
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.820
with such care

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:42.540
will never wither

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.160
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:49.040
Now, all together

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.500
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.170
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:59.110
They're always right by our sides

00:01:59.090 --> 00:01:59.920
So together

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:03.720
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.680
bloom even more!

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.230
HeartCatch

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.730
Precure!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.950
Precures,

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.950
Precures,

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:48.970
You won't ever be able to change.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:55.570
Not until you can bid farewell to your shy, withdrawn self.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.370
I will...

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.370
I will change!

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.880
Blossom's sure taking her time.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:14.770
What will happen to her if she doesn't pass the trial?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.440
She'll just remain as she always was.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:30.090
The HeartCatch Mirage's trial is simply to be shown yourself as you truly are.

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:35.770
Everyone is afraid to know their true self.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:41.690
It can be saddening to realize just how weak, petty, and shallow we can be.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.250
But we are all capable of changing.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:53.570
Rather than trying to escape the reality of who we are, we can try to understand ourselves.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:59.610
Sometimes, that means accepting facets 
of ourselves that we'd rather didn't exist.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.540
But you have to ask yourself,

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.250
"What is it I want to do?"

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.180
"What is it I should be doing?"

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.370
It's something that we all worry about and stress over.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.250
But from that despair we find our light,

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.150
and that gives us the hope we need.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.310
Now it's Tsubomi's turn to face it.

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:43.530
Only she is capable of defeating her own demons.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:50.040
If Tsubomi's heart is to grow stronger, then that is something she must do for herself.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.490
I'm still so worried about her!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:54.700
Yeah!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.040
Blossom's such a coward, and so unreliable, and...

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:02.360
She kept on calling herself the
 weakest Precure ever at first, and...

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.200
And... And she...

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.010
She's so withdrawn!

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:09.600
She's so useless without us to help her!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.060
We'll just have to hope she pulls through.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.720
Our beloved Blossom.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:20.650
Blossom! Don't give up, you got that?!

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:24.860
We're right here cheering you on!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.320
You can do it!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.300
Oh desert seed, the Desert Devil...

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:55.900
Before the HeartCatch Mirage can unleash its true power,

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.390
I bid you to destroy it.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:05.190
Cure Flower,

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:12.150
I'll be taking back the power the HeartCatch Mirage stole from me fifty years ago.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:21.210
But knowing you, you'll surely notice my presence nearby.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:26.870
Girls, the Desert Devil's on its way here!

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:27.420
What?!

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:32.010
But Blossom hasn't finished the final trial yet.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:41.890
We are shy and withdrawn, 
always relying on others to save us.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.860
That's how we truly are!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:47.230
I...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.790
It's true that I was like that in the past!

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:53.780
But I really have changed since then!

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.510
No, you haven't changed at all.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:01.960
I have changed!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:08.800
And becoming a Precure cannot change what lies within.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.120
It's gigantic!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:41.000
The Desert Devil is trying to 
destroy the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.810
How are we meant to fight that thing?

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.900
We can handle this!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.360
We'll just beat that thing up before Blossom gets back!

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:54.120
Let's go, Coffret!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.510
Aye aye!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.490
We'd better go as well.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:24.010
Marine Impact!

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:32.950
All right!

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:46.730
Don't give in, girls.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.710
You can do it.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.850
You don't have to look at me.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:57.630
You can run away from me if you wish.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:04.050
And then, you won't have to face your own weakness.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:08.070
You can stay as you are. You don't have to change.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:13.270
That way you don't have to admit your 
weakness is your own fault, and you can keep 

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.520
relying on other people!

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:28.920
Just stop this pointless attempt at fighting me,

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.550
and accept that you are incapable of changing!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.830
I...

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:41.950
It's all right.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:48.350
Mom, Dad, and all our friends will still love us just the way we are.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:52.410
Even if you don't transform, and even if you don't fight,

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:56.190
they'll still love you just the same.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:58.750
Okay?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.550
I can't do that.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:13.170
All this time, I just despised the
 fact I was so shy and withdrawn.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.840
All I was doing was hating myself.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.680
But then I met everyone.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:36.110
Make sure to protect the Precure Palace while we fight, you two!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.050
Flowers, shine forth!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.460
Precure Silver Forte Wave!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.600
My friends, who are so strong and kind...

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:00.210
I love them all so very much!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:04.900
It's because they're there that I can give my all!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:07.640
I feel...

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:14.020
that I have changed, even if only a little!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:19.290
I feel like I've gained the strength to create a new me!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.950
You're the me who hadn't quite found that resolution.

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:36.840
The me who was scared to become a new person.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.880
But I can change.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:43.820
I <i>will</i> change!

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:55.730
You don't need your shy, withdrawn old self anymore, do you?

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:29.840
I thought the final trial was meant to power us up.h

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:32.790
Complaining won't get you anywhere.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:46.850
It looks like we'll need to combine our 
powers if we're going to beat this thing.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:50.670
We'll just have to hang on till Blossom gets back!

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.050
Coffret, let's give this another try!

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.630
Roger!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.760
We'd better get out there too, Chypre!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:13.800
Got it!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.510
Flowers, shine forth!

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:35.580
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:42.410
The feelings that got me here all seemed so half-hearted

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.040
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.250
You're late.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:46.010
But there's no turning back now

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:44.960
Aww, it's fine!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:49.800
Now that we're all back together again, let's take down this Desert Devil!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:55.430
I just have to trust in all my hard work, and take the first step

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.920
Okay!

00:15:55.430 --> 00:16:00.180
Now's the time to take the plunge, ready, go!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.100
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:04.190
So no matter how afraid we feel

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:07.190
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.190
We'll never give up, cause even though you can't see it

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:14.450
We've found a treasure more precious than any other

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.560
Flowers, shine forth!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:13.910
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:19.900
In the boundless skies of my heart

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:16.110
Flowers, shine forth!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:20.450
Precure Silver Forte Wave!

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:27.470
This melody takes flight

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.400
Flowers, dance for me!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:34.180
My heart goes on, and I won't let a moment go to waste

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:32.470
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:42.320
And though my tears fall, slowly the seed shall bloom into a beautiful flower

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.630
Let's use a Fortissimo!

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:44.440
Okay!

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.480
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:52.920
Must be nice doing a Fortissimo with Moonlight.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.530
We can do one too!

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.200
You wanna do a Fortissimo?

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.660
Let's do it!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:02.000
All right then! Let's go!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:07.080
In the sunny skies of my heart

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.500
Yeah!

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:11.040
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:14.500
I soar into a higher octave

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:17.410
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:21.420
My heart goes on, and when it resounds with all of my friends

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:27.900
Those distant dreams can one day become reality

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:35.900
By love's gentle touch, and the light of the stars, we're all shining here together

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.710
HeartCatch Mirage!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:53.520
Now's our chance to try out their new power!

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.760
Here's the Powerup Sheed!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.400
Let's do this, you guys!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:09.750
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:40.220
The shining flowers illuminating the world!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:46.230
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:54.000
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:02.180
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:01.620
There's something I realized while we were facing the final trial.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:08.270
If we are to defeat the Desert Apostles, the four of us merely combining our powers won't be enough.

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:11.890
We each have to grow as people so we're able to stand on our own two feet.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.400
Only then can we truly combine our powers effectively.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:21.710
That's why we each had to face our true selves, right?

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:26.200
And it wasn't just a matter of fighting against ourselves.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:32.080
We had to be able to accept the parts of ourselves we don't like so that we can change them too!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.060
Right?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:13.040
You don't need your shy, withdrawn old self anymore, do you?

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:20.800
That's not true.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:27.240
If I'm going to truly be myself, then I need to accept my slightly cowardly side.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:33.740
That's why I love my shy, withdrawn side too!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.060
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Come on, all together now!

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:25.740
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:32.670
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.800 --> 00:23:00.030
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:04.440
All those

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:09.030
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:14.280
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.950
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.170
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:27.300
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.340
With all our might!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:47.740
<i>To counter the threat of the HeartCatch Mirage, the Desert Apostles have let loose our strongest foe yet!</i>

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:51.570
<i>The fearsome devil that lurks in the darkness, Bossnacky!</i>

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.620
<i>If he's after us, then we're finished!</i>

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:55.270
<i>Don't give up yet!</i>

00:23:55.270 --> 00:23:58.040
<i>Cure Marine'll beat him with a Blue Forte Wave!</i>

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:00.460
<i>Sorry, but I kinda lost my Marine Tact.</i>

00:24:00.760 --> 00:24:02.210
<i>Whaaaaat?!</i>

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:03.790
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.920
Erika's in Trouble<i>!</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.920
Erika's in Trouble<i>!</i>

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:08.670
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
